# Comment Scenario - Tests confluence-comment skill
# Page and inline comment operations
---
prompt: |
  Show me comments on the API Reference page
expect:
  tools:
    must_call: [Skill]
  text:
    must_not_contain: [error, "not found"]
  semantic: |
    Response should show any comments on the API Reference page,
    or indicate if there are no comments.
---
prompt: |
  Add a comment to the API Reference page: This documentation is very helpful for new developers!
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [comment, added]
    must_not_contain: [error, failed]
  semantic: |
    Response should confirm a comment was added
    to the API Reference page.
---
prompt: |
  Show me the comment I just added
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [helpful, developers]
    must_not_contain: [error, "not found"]
  semantic: |
    Response should show the recently added comment
    about helpful documentation.
---
prompt: |
  Add a comment to the Q1 Planning page: Let's schedule a review meeting for next week
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [comment, Q1 Planning]
    must_not_contain: [error, failed]
  semantic: |
    Response should confirm adding a comment
    to the Q1 Planning page.
---
prompt: |
  Delete the comment I added to the API Reference page
expect:
  text:
    must_contain: [delete, comment]
    must_not_contain: [error, failed]
  semantic: |
    Response should confirm the comment was deleted.
---
